\chapter{Roadmap}

\section{Stage 1 --- the walking skeleton}

<The thinnest vertical slice that tangles to a RUNNING system. It must touch
every Stage-1 concept, however thinly — a skeleton that skips a concept does
not prove the architecture. When this builds green end to end, the shape is
proven and everything after is thickening.>

